❗️ The Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continue to launch strikes by unmanned aerial vehicles against energy infrastructure facilities, logistics centres of Ukraine, and vessels involved in the interests of the Armed Forces of Ukraine.

💥 This afternoon, as a result of the strikes, they hit:

▫️ two 330 kV and 110 kV power substations, which provided support for enterprises of the Ukrainian defence industry in Nezhin and Sosnitsa (Chernigov region);

▫️ the Epicentr logistics centre, where military cargo was stored and distributed in Kirovograd (Kropivnitsky);

▫️a dry cargo ship with weapons and military equipment for the Armed Forces of Ukraine in the Black Sea, 7 km south-western of Odessa.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry
